-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §47 חישוב ושיבוץ עתידיים: the conversion is
-- done on X as it is on the eve of the move, and again on X as it will be
-- at each date of §4 of the public-sector agreement of 21.2.08 after the
-- move; a placement it changes is corrected from that date, the time in
-- the grade counting from it; the teacher gets the figures on a form; and
-- the clause's worked example. §4 of 21.2.08 is that agreement's module,
-- imported (l4/agreements/teachers-general/2008-02-21_teachers_tosefet-2008_wage-supplement.l4):
-- its dates and its rate on each. The agreement of 17.6.2009 amends §47's
-- dates to match §4(א)(3) of 21.2.08 as put off to October 2011
-- (l4/agreements/teachers-general/2009-06-17_teachers_wage-update-deferral.l4,
-- which imports this file); the agreement of 24.11.2010 confines §47 to
-- the dates of §4(א)(1) and (2), with no conversion at the third
-- (l4/agreements/teachers-general/2010-11-24_teachers_wage-update-advancement.l4),
-- as §35(ב) of the agreement of 29.2.2012 then words it; the rules here
-- are the clause as signed.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `base-agreement-44`
IMPORT `2008-02-21_teachers_tosefet-2008_wage-supplement`
§ `47 חישוב ושיבוץ עתידיים`

-- (א): the conversions, on X now and on X raised at each later date of the
-- 21.2.08 agreement (the 2008 supplement's steps: 1.5% from 1.1.2008, 5%
-- in all from 1.12.2009, as the example reads them). `A at a later date`
-- converts X raised by a step; the steps and their dates are §4(א) of
-- 21.2.08, imported.
@ref akn:art_47__para_a
GIVEN x IS A NUMBER, y IS A NUMBER, `the 2008 supplement's step` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `A at a later date` x y `the 2008 supplement's step` IS
    `A, the converted pay` (x TIMES (1 PLUS `the 2008 supplement's step`)) y

-- The dates (א) converts again at: §4's dates "that apply after the
-- teacher's move" — the conversion of the move itself is on X as it was on
-- the eve, so a step from the day of the move on is a later date.
GIVEN `moved to the reform on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A LIST OF DATE
DECIDE `the dates §47 converts X again at` `moved to the reform on` IS
    filter (GIVEN d YIELD d `is on or after` `moved to the reform on`) `the dates of §4(א) of the agreement of 21.2.2008`

-- A at a date of §4: X raised by the 21.2.08 agreement's rate on that day.
GIVEN x IS A NUMBER, y IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `A on a date of §47` x y d IS
    `A at a later date` x y (`the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement rate on` d)

-- (ב): a later conversion that changes the grade corrects it from that
-- date, and the time in the grade counts from it.
@ref akn:art_47__para_b
GIVEN `grade before` IS A NUMBER, `grade by the later conversion` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the placement is corrected` `grade before` `grade by the later conversion` IF
    NOT (`grade before` EQUALS `grade by the later conversion`)

DECLARE `section 47 action` IS ONE OF `give the teacher the conversion form`

-- (ג) ¶1: at the conversion, a form with the salary to convert, the
-- determining salary, the seniority, the grade now and the grades to come.
@ref akn:art_47__para_c
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `section 47 action`
DECIDE `the conversion form` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `give the teacher the conversion form`
    LEST BREACH BY `the Ministry of Education` BECAUSE "section 47(ג): the teacher gets the conversion figures on a form"

-- The example (¶2–¶21): a regular first-degree teacher, full-time, in a
-- primary school (17%), seniority 15, X = 7,000, moved in September 2007.
-- The three values of A it prints; the table cells (8,414; 8,625.22;
-- 8,840.49 at grade 4.5) are the annexes', inputs here. The second and
-- third are at the dates of 21.2.08 (1.1.2008 and 1.12.2009), at its rate.
@ref akn:art_47__para_c/p2 akn:art_47__para_c/p3 akn:art_47__para_c/p4 akn:art_47__para_c/p5 akn:art_47__para_c/p6 akn:art_47__para_c/p7 akn:art_47__para_c/p8 akn:art_47__para_c/p9 akn:art_47__para_c/p10 akn:art_47__para_c/p11 akn:art_47__para_c/p12 akn:art_47__para_c/p13 akn:art_47__para_c/p14 akn:art_47__para_c/p15 akn:art_47__para_c/p16 akn:art_47__para_c/p17 akn:art_47__para_c/p18 akn:art_47__para_c/p19 akn:art_47__para_c/p20 akn:art_47__para_c/p21
#ASSERT `A at a later date` 7000 17 0 EQUALS 8190
#ASSERT `A on a date of §47` 7000 17 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2008) EQUALS 8312.85
#ASSERT `A on a date of §47` 7000 17 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2009) EQUALS 8599.5
#ASSERT NOT `the placement is corrected` 4.5 4.5

-- The example's teacher moved in September 2007: all three dates of §4
-- are after his move.
#ASSERT `the dates §47 converts X again at` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2007) EQUALS `the dates of §4(א) of the agreement of 21.2.2008`
#ASSERT `the dates §47 converts X again at` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2009) EQUALS LIST DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2009
